{"seq":2,"slug":"rtos-and-scheduling","title":"RTOS 与调度","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rtos-fundamentals","title":"RTOS 基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/rtos-fundamentals","wordCount":879,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"freertos-in-practice","title":"FreeRTOS 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/freertos-in-practice","wordCount":676,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"low-power-design","title":"低功耗设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/low-power-design","wordCount":718,"readingTime":3},{"seq":4,"slug":"real-time-constraints","title":"实时约束与时序分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/real-time-constraints","wordCount":859,"readingTime":4},{"seq":5,"slug":"task-scheduling-algorithms","title":"任务调度算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/task-scheduling-algorithms","wordCount":987,"readingTime":4},{"seq":6,"slug":"zephyr-and-modern-frameworks","title":"Zephyr RTOS 与现代嵌入式框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/zephyr-and-modern-frameworks","wordCount":581,"readingTime":3}],"introMarkdown":"# RTOS 与调度 简介\n\n本章从裸机编程过渡到实时操作系统，介绍嵌入式软件开发中最重要的系统抽象层。当项目复杂度超越简单的中断驱动模型时，RTOS 提供了任务管理、同步通信和时序保证等关键能力，是构建可靠嵌入式系统的基础设施。\n\n本章包含四个核心主题。**RTOS 基础**部分阐明实时操作系统与通用操作系统的本质区别，讲解任务状态机、优先级机制、信号量、互斥量和消息队列等核心原语的设计动机与使用模式。**FreeRTOS 实战**部分以全球最广泛使用的开源 RTOS 为例，从项目配置、任务创建到任务间通信，完成一个完整的多任务应用开发流程。\n\n**任务调度算法**部分系统对比抢占式优先级调度、时间片轮转、最早截止时间优先（EDF）和速率单调调度（RMS）等经典算法的原理、优势与局限性。**实时性约束**部分讨论硬实时与软实时系统的区分标准、最坏情况执行时间（WCET）分析方法以及调度可行性的数学验证。\n\n建议先完成第一章的基础内容再学习本章。RTOS 的任务抽象建立在对中断、内存和硬件机制的理解之上。\n"}